1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,213
Independent assortment has a catch.

2
00:00:02,213 --> 00:00:09,544
In nineteen oh six Bateson and Punnett crossed sweet peas, purple with long pollen against red with round pollen.

3
00:00:09,544 --> 00:00:13,138
The F two should have been nine three three one.

4
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:14,166
It was not.

5
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:20,390
The two parental combinations were far too common, and the two new combinations far too rare.

